ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"成帝元延三年，校猎长杨射熊馆。五柞宫门外有柞树五。又南有...","context_before":"...。长杨有长杨数亩。杨雄作《长杨宫赋》，谓此宫门有射熊馆。","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e2754594-5c16-503d-9db0-4935d9647266","source_start_index":115,"source_text":"元帝永元五年，幸长杨射熊馆。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3冬，上幸長楊射熊館，大獵。","content_fanyi":"冬季，汉元帝巡幸长杨宫射熊馆，举行大规模围猎。","content_jianti_auto":"3冬，上幸长杨射熊馆，大猎。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2267,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"918df086-db0e-11ef-bfa1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"玄成","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄成","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918df090-db0e-11ef-be47-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"高皇帝","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"918df091-db0e-11ef-be44-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"太祖","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"918df092-db0e-11ef-9d88-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝文皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝文皇帝","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"918df093-db0e-11ef-8189-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"太宗","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"918df094-db0e-11ef-be3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝景皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝景皇帝","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"918df095-db0e-11ef-a384-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝武皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝武皇帝","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"918df096-db0e-11ef-b589-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝昭皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝昭皇帝","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"918df097-db0e-11ef-b8be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝宣皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝宣皇帝","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"918df098-db0e-11ef-bd9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太上皇","people_name_jianti_auto":"太上皇","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"918df099-db0e-11ef-a760-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝惠","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝惠","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"918df09a-db0e-11ef-b25a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"玄成等奏曰：「祖宗之廟，世世不毀；繼祖以下，五廟而迭毀。今高皇帝爲太祖，孝文皇帝爲太宗，孝景皇帝爲昭，孝武皇帝爲穆，孝昭皇帝與孝宣皇帝俱爲昭。皇考廟，親未盡。太上皇、孝惠廟皆親盡，宜毀。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"玄成等奏曰：「祖宗之庙，世世不毁；继祖以下，五庙而迭毁。今高皇帝为太祖，孝文皇帝为太宗，孝景皇帝为昭，孝武皇帝为穆，孝昭皇帝与孝宣皇帝俱为昭。皇考庙，亲未尽。太上皇、孝惠庙皆亲尽，宜毁。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"918df08f-db0e-11ef-8780-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-197,"link_td_description":"刘太公，战国时代晚期到汉初时期沛郡丰邑（今江苏省丰县）人，是汉朝建立者刘邦的父亲，尊号为太上皇。","link_td_id":"Q10000883","link_td_number_id":398038,"people_name":"太上皇","people_name_jianti_auto":"太上皇","people_xingming":"刘执嘉","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"918df09b-db0e-11ef-8a41-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘执嘉]"},{"link_birth_year":-211,"link_death_year":-188,"link_td_description":"汉惠帝刘盈，汉朝开国皇帝汉高帝刘邦和皇后吕氏之子，汉朝皇帝，于前195年6月26日—前188年9月26日在位，在位7年，其正式谥号为“孝惠皇帝”。","link_td_id":"Q10000195","link_td_number_id":106737,"people_name":"孝惠皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝惠皇帝","people_xingming":"刘盈","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"918df09c-db0e-11ef-899e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘盈]"},{"link_death_year":-41,"link_td_description":"韦玄成，字少翁，鲁国邹人。西汉丞相韦贤庶第四子。","link_td_id":"Q10007784","link_td_number_id":1075763,"people_name":"韋玄成","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦玄成","people_xingming":"韦玄成","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"918df09d-db0e-11ef-bcc4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4十二月，乙酉，毀太上皇、孝惠皇帝寢廟園，用韋玄成等之議也。","content_fanyi":"十二月十六日乙酉，汉元帝采纳丞相韦玄成等人的建议，将太上皇刘执嘉和孝惠帝刘盈的祖庙及陵园拆毁。","content_jianti_auto":"4十二月，乙酉，毁太上皇、孝惠皇帝寝庙园，用韦玄成等之议也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2268,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"918df08e-db0e-11ef-9c40-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"918df0a2-db0e-11ef-8d73-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"918df0a3-db0e-11ef-96e1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：乙十一行本「以」上有「自」字；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：乙十一行本「以」上有「自」字；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918df0a1-db0e-11ef-88da-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"918df0a0-db0e-11ef-97ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"元帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"元帝","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"918df0a5-db0e-11ef-b2f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"918df0a6-db0e-11ef-abbe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"外戚傳曰：元帝加昭儀之號，位視丞相，爵比諸侯王。師古曰：昭顯其儀，示隆重也。濟，子禮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"外戚传曰：元帝加昭仪之号，位视丞相，爵比诸侯王。师古曰：昭显其仪，示隆重也。济，子礼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"918df